{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13111350","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13111350","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1311135001:1":{"text":"고마워요, 루보미르 님. 알레나 공주님의 상황을 알았으니 이제 가봐야 할 것 같아요.","source_cn":"谢谢你，柳博米尔先生。既然已经知道了亚莲娜公主的情况，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FE1902A3B7E6E1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1311135002:1":{"text":"타임 루프가 아직 끝나지 않았으니 공주에게 큰 문제가 생겼을지도 몰라요... 상황이 점점 더 나빠지고 있으니 가능한 한 빨리 이 일을 해결해야 해요!","source_cn":"时间循环没有结束，公主可能有大问题……情况越来越严重了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABEF486FDC32EDD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1311135003:1":{"text":"발리카, 이들과 함께 가실 건가요?","source_cn":"瓦丽卡，你也要和他们一起去吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE8A076D7754C39F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1311135004:1":{"text":"...응.","source_cn":"……是的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC54966B7C3DA2BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1311135005:1":{"text":"당신은 여전하네요. 스스로를 의심하고 괴롭히면서도 책임을 내려놓지 못하는...","source_cn":"你还是那样，始终在自我怀疑和折磨，却放不下责任……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1A47FD4432DB7C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1311135006:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1311135007:1":{"text":"알레나의 모습을 하고 있는 자가 저희 가문의 명예를 더럽혔어요.","source_cn":"那个顶着亚莲娜面容的人，玷污了我们家族的荣誉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF893D6AE13B4C695","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1311135008:1":{"text":"진실이 어떻든, 모든 일이 순조롭기를 바라겠습니다.","source_cn":"无论真相如何，我衷心希望你们一切顺利。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7AC083D1D687E59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1311135009:1":{"text":"가시죠, 배웅해 드릴게요.","source_cn":"走吧，我送你们出去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C07596B150E0B63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:柳博米尔":{"text":"루보미르","source":"柳博米尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瓦丽卡":{"text":"발리카","source":"瓦丽卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":4}}